  "local_changes": [
    "Separate selectable Plasma Style; original Classic files stay byte-identical.",
    "New straight four-pixel nine-slice bevels, woven pixel housings and ruled lower command rail.",
    "New opaque Iconbox, instrument sockets, field and popup art; solid-blue dial with white native clock hands.",
    "Pager active frame uses narrow yellow rim; empty overlay centers preserve native window outlines over an opaque panel.",
    "Legacy resources retain their element contracts; semi-transparent paint and gradient definitions are flattened and rounded rectangle radii are removed.",
    "Native shadow contracts remain empty; input states use immediate inverted relief.",
    "Local colors file supplies the matching Plasma palette without selecting an application scheme or changing a layout.",
    "HP reference relief refinement: four distinct opaque one-pixel contour/highlight/counter-relief/blue-lip bands; pressed and recessed rims reverse those bands. Four-pixel margins, SVG IDs/bounds and native center tiling stay unchanged."
  ],
